#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:6
msgid "Streaming a camera view in a visualizer"
msgstr "在可视化器中显示相机流视图"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:10
msgid ""
"Display ground-truth camera frames from many environments in one live "
"visualizer panel. For how the view works and which visualizers support it, "
"see :ref:`visualization-streaming-camera-view`."
msgstr ""
"在同一个实时可视化面板中显示多个环境的真值相机图像。视图原理及受支持的可视化器见 :ref:`visualization-streaming-"
"camera-view`。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:15
msgid "Sharing a view with recording"
msgstr "与录制共享视图"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:17
msgid ""
"``ImageViewCfg`` selects pixels independently of their destination. A scene "
"sensor name binds an existing camera; its renderer and capture cadence "
"remain owned by the scene. ``WindowCfg`` controls presentation independently"
" through ``VisualizerCfg.window``. ``VisualizerCfg.view`` and "
"``VideoRecorderCfg.source`` can consume the same selection:"
msgstr ""
"``ImageViewCfg`` "
"选择像素内容，与显示或录制目的地无关。场景传感器名称绑定已有相机，渲染器与捕获节奏仍由场景管理。``WindowCfg`` 通过 "
"``VisualizerCfg.window`` 独立控制显示。``VisualizerCfg.view`` 与 "
"``VideoRecorderCfg.source`` 可以使用同一选择："

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:32
msgid ""
"Use ``--viz newton_gl`` (or ``--viz newton_rtx`` for the RTX example) to "
"display the window. Omit ``--viz`` for recording alone. The scene must "
"declare ``front_camera`` with both requested outputs. The view preserves "
"environment order and native tile dimensions, placing channels beside each "
"other. ``channels`` selects existing outputs; ``depth_range`` only maps "
"depth values to display colors. Neither changes the source camera's outputs,"
" measurements, or clipping planes. ``CameraCfg.width`` and ``height`` set "
"sensor resolution. ``WindowCfg.size`` sets the initial window dimensions; "
"the window scales the composed image for display. Resizing a sensor's window"
" leaves both sensor and composed-image storage unchanged. The recorder "
"encodes the native composed image. Only encoding downloads pixels; display "
"uses the device image. Invalid recording sources or channel selections raise"
" errors when the recorder binds its source after simulation reset; they do "
"not silently disable recording. Subsequent frames use the bound capture "
"function without looking up the producer again."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--viz newton_gl`` 显示窗口，RTX 示例则使用 ``--viz newton_rtx``；仅录制时省略 "
"``--viz``。场景必须声明 "
"``front_camera``，并包含所请求的两种输出。视图保留环境顺序和原生平铺尺寸，将不同通道并排排列。``channels`` "
"选择已有输出，``depth_range`` 仅将深度值映射为显示颜色，二者都不改变源相机的输出、测量或裁剪面。``CameraCfg.width`` "
"和 ``height`` 设置传感器分辨率，``WindowCfg.size`` "
"设置初始窗口尺寸，窗口缩放合成图像用于显示。调整传感器窗口大小不会改变传感器及合成图像的存储。录制器编码原生合成图像，只有编码时才下载像素，显示直接使用设备图像。仿真重置后，录制器绑定来源时会检查无效的录制源或通道选择并报错，不会静默关闭录制。后续帧使用已绑定的捕获函数，不再重复查找图像生成器。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:44
msgid ""
"Reusing the same ``ImageViewCfg`` shares one runtime frame within a "
"simulation, including through copies of the enclosing configuration. Use "
"``isaaclab.utils.replace(view, ...)`` for an independent selection. Reading "
"the shared view twice in one physics step reuses its frame and sensor "
"acquisition. Changing the view's selection rebuilds composition state; "
"captured composition graphs must then be recreated. This does not resize the"
" sensor's render product."
msgstr ""
"在同一仿真中复用同一个 ``ImageViewCfg``，会共享同一个运行时帧，即使外层配置被复制也如此。需要独立选择时，使用 "
"``isaaclab.utils.replace(view, "
"...)``。同一物理步内重复读取共享视图会复用已有帧和传感器采集结果。改变视图选择会重建合成状态，已捕获的合成图也必须重建；这不会调整传感器渲染产物的大小。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:50
msgid ""
"For Newton RTX, a perspective declaration is expanded into an ordinary scene"
" camera before launch:"
msgstr "对于 Newton RTX，透视视图声明会在启动前展开为普通场景相机："

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:63
msgid ""
"Newton RTX fixes perspective render resolution at the initial "
"``WindowCfg.size``; resizing the window scales its image. Newton GL "
"perspective rendering follows its window framebuffer dimensions. The "
"recorder reads the completed native render without requesting a second "
"render for that step. Perspective views currently provide one RGB image, so "
"keep ``envs=(0,)`` and ``channels=(\"rgb\",)``. A recorded perspective view "
"requires exactly one configured rendering visualizer. In headless runs, the "
"launcher retains that producer without opening a window; recording a sensor "
"view needs no visualizer."
msgstr ""
"Newton RTX 将透视渲染分辨率固定为初始 ``WindowCfg.size``，窗口变化时缩放图像；Newton GL "
"的透视渲染则跟随窗口帧缓冲区尺寸。录制器读取已完成的原生渲染，不会在同一步请求第二次渲染。目前透视视图仅提供一张 RGB 图像，因此应保留 "
"``envs=(0,)`` 和 "
"``channels=(\"rgb\",)``。录制透视视图时，必须且只能配置一个渲染型可视化器。无界面运行时，启动器保留该图像生成器但不打开窗口；录制传感器视图无需可视化器。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:70
msgid ""
"``VisualizerCfg.view`` is supported by Newton GL and RTX. Existing "
"``cameras`` and ``streaming_*`` configurations and CLI recording source "
"strings remain supported; they are translated at initialization. Use "
"``view`` instead of combining it with legacy camera selection fields."
msgstr ""
"Newton GL 和 RTX 支持 ``VisualizerCfg.view``。现有的 ``cameras``、``streaming_*`` "
"配置和命令行录制来源字符串仍受支持，会在初始化时转换。请使用 ``view``，不要将它与旧版相机选择字段混用。"

