#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:116
msgid "Choose and control displayed views"
msgstr "选择和控制显示视图"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Kit** launches the streaming view as a separate **Streaming View** "
"viewport, selectable from the Viewport tabs; it can also be placed side by "
"side with the default interactive viewport for dual monitoring."
msgstr ""
"**Kit** 将流式视图打开为独立的 **Streaming View** 视口，可从 Viewport "
"标签页选择，也可与默认交互视口并排显示，便于同时监测。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Newton GL and Newton RTX** have a **Camera View** selector in the sidebar."
" Selecting a scene camera displays its tiled output in the main viewport "
"instead of rendering a perspective view behind it. Selecting a perspective "
"camera restores interactive scene rendering. Newton GL also restores "
"picking."
msgstr ""
"**Newton GL 和 Newton RTX** 在侧边栏提供 **Camera View** "
"选择器。选择场景相机后，主视口显示其平铺输出，不再在背后渲染透视视图；选择透视相机后恢复交互场景渲染，Newton GL 也恢复拾取。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:126
msgid ""
"Without an explicit ``cameras`` list, Newton GL starts in perspective and "
"offers scene cameras that provide every requested ``streaming_gt_types`` "
"channel. An explicit ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` starts with that scene "
"camera selected. For example, set ``streaming_gt_types=(\"depth\",)`` to "
"offer depth-only cameras. The RGB view accepts RGB or RGBA outputs; the "
"display uses opaque alpha. No images are captured to build the selector. "
"Explicitly configured scene-camera choices must support the requested "
"channels; incompatible choices raise a configuration error during "
"initialization, including inactive choices."
msgstr ""
"未显式提供 ``cameras`` 列表时，Newton GL 从透视视图启动，并列出提供所有所需 ``streaming_gt_types`` "
"通道的场景相机。显式设置 ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` 时，以该场景相机作为初始选择。例如，设置 "
"``streaming_gt_types=(\"depth\",)`` 可列出仅提供深度的相机。RGB 视图接受 RGB 或 RGBA "
"输出，显示时使用不透明 alpha。构建选择器不会捕获图像。显式配置的场景相机选项必须支持所需通道，不兼容的选项会在初始化时报错，即使该选项未启用。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:134
msgid ""
"Newton RTX displays only the sources declared in ``view`` or ``cameras``. "
"With neither set, launch preparation declares one perspective camera. Scene "
"sensors are never added to its selector automatically."
msgstr ""
"Newton RTX 仅显示 ``view`` 或 ``cameras`` "
"声明的来源。两者均未设置时，启动准备会声明一个透视相机，不会自动将场景传感器加入选择器。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:137
msgid ""
"Use ``cameras`` to declare a list of selectable views; the first starts "
"active:"
msgstr "使用 ``cameras`` 声明可切换视图列表，第一项初始启用："

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:153
msgid ""
"The ``cameras`` field is shared across visualizers. Kit, Rerun, and Viser "
"use the first scene camera for their image panel; Newton GL and RTX provide "
"the source dropdown shown above. ``SceneCameraCfg`` selects an existing "
"sensor; ``PerspectiveCameraCfg`` configures the viewer's interactive camera."
" For Newton RTX, ``launch_simulation(env_cfg, ...)`` adds a ``CameraCfg`` to"
" the scene before any scene objects are constructed and selects it through "
"``SceneCameraCfg``. Newton GL retains its native perspective camera. Newton "
"RTX keeps its perspective render resolution fixed at the initial "
"``WindowCfg.size``; resizing its window scales the displayed image. Sensor "
"resolution remains controlled by ``CameraCfg``. Window resizing does not "
"reallocate sensor or RTX perspective image buffers. Newton GL perspective "
"images follow its framebuffer dimensions. Newton windows present at up to "
"``WindowCfg.fps`` (30 by default), measured in wall-clock time. Changing the"
" simulation timestep does not change that limit. Headless on-demand capture "
"is independent of the window update rate; Kit uses its application's update "
"cadence."
msgstr ""
"``cameras`` 字段由各可视化器共用。Kit、Rerun 和 Viser 在图像面板中使用第一个场景相机；Newton GL 和 RTX "
"则提供上述来源下拉框。``SceneCameraCfg`` 选择已有传感器，``PerspectiveCameraCfg`` 配置查看器的交互相机。对于"
" Newton RTX，``launch_simulation(env_cfg, ...)`` 在构造任何场景对象前向场景添加 "
"``CameraCfg``，并通过 ``SceneCameraCfg`` 选择它。Newton GL 保留原生透视相机。Newton RTX "
"的透视渲染分辨率固定为初始 ``WindowCfg.size``，窗口变化时缩放图像；传感器分辨率仍由 ``CameraCfg`` "
"控制。调整窗口大小不会重新分配传感器或 RTX 透视图像缓冲区。Newton GL 透视图像则跟随帧缓冲区尺寸。Newton 窗口按实际时间最多以 "
"``WindowCfg.fps`` 显示，默认为 30；改变仿真时间步不会改变此上限。无窗口按需捕获与窗口更新频率无关，Kit 使用应用自身的更新节奏。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:167
msgid ""
"Newton RTX displays ordinary camera output in a Newton GL window. Equal "
"``OVRTXRendererCfg`` configurations share one renderer and its scene. "
"``NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg.renderer_cfg`` selects the renderer for generated "
"perspective cameras; explicitly selected scene cameras retain their own "
"renderer. Newton's ``ViewerRTX`` and its borrowed-stage interface are not "
"used. ``isaaclab_ov.stage.OvstageBackend`` remains available for downstream "
"consumers that need an independent native stage. Its ``populate(stage, "
"plan)`` method imports and clones a declared scene."
msgstr ""
"Newton RTX 在 Newton GL 窗口中显示普通相机输出。相等的 ``OVRTXRendererCfg`` "
"配置共享同一个渲染器及其场景。``NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg.renderer_cfg`` "
"为生成的透视相机选择渲染器，显式选中的场景相机则保留各自的渲染器。这里不使用 Newton 的 ``ViewerRTX`` "
"及其借用舞台接口。``isaaclab_ov.stage.OvstageBackend`` 仍可供需要独立原生舞台的下游使用者使用，其 "
"``populate(stage, plan)`` 方法导入并克隆已声明的场景。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:174
msgid ""
"The camera owns pose, calibration, image buffers, capture, and cleanup. "
"Window navigation calls ``Camera.set_world_poses`` and "
"``Camera.set_intrinsic_matrices``; image reads use ``Camera.data``. There is"
" no separate perspective rendering entry point. No default lights are added:"
" scenes without authored lights remain unlit. Closing a window leaves its "
"scene camera and renderer alive."
msgstr ""
"相机负责位姿、标定、图像缓冲区、捕获和清理。窗口导航调用 ``Camera.set_world_poses`` 和 "
"``Camera.set_intrinsic_matrices``，图像通过 ``Camera.data`` "
"读取，不存在单独的透视渲染入口。系统不添加默认灯光，未定义灯光的场景保持无光照状态。关闭窗口后，其场景相机和渲染器继续存活。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:179
msgid ""
"Scripts without an ``InteractiveSceneCfg`` use ``ReplicateSession`` to "
"declare their scene before spawning assets and cameras, including for a "
"single environment:"
msgstr ""
"没有 ``InteractiveSceneCfg`` 的脚本使用 "
"``ReplicateSession``，在生成资产和相机前声明场景，即使只有一个环境也如此："

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:216
msgid ""
"The script retains the camera and advances its sensor timing, just as it "
"does for other directly spawned sensors. ``SceneCameraCfg`` discovers it by "
"prim path without an ``InteractiveScene``."
msgstr ""
"脚本持有相机并推进其传感器计时，与其他直接生成的传感器相同。``SceneCameraCfg`` 可通过 prim 路径发现它，无需 "
"``InteractiveScene``。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:219
msgid ""
"Display layout and channel mappings are compiled when the source, selection,"
" resolution, or color settings change. Composition writes into reusable "
"device RGBA storage. Newton GL, Newton RTX, and Kit present CUDA images "
"without downloading pixels. Recording through ``render_tiled_rgb_array()`` "
"and the Rerun/Viser transports explicitly read back the composed image. The "
"GPU API, ``render_tiled_rgba_array()``, returns borrowed storage that is "
"reused on the next composition; consumers must copy it if they need to "
"retain a frame."
msgstr ""
"当来源、选择、分辨率或颜色设置改变时，会编译显示布局与通道映射。合成写入可复用的设备 RGBA 存储。Newton GL、Newton RTX 和 "
"Kit 直接显示 CUDA 图像，不下载像素；通过 ``render_tiled_rgb_array()`` 录制，以及 Rerun/Viser "
"传输，则会显式回读合成图像。GPU API ``render_tiled_rgba_array()`` "
"返回借用的存储，下一次合成时会复用；如需保留帧，使用者必须复制。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:226
msgid ""
"Both scene cameras must already be declared as ``CameraCfg`` entries in the "
"scene. Keyboard and mouse navigation moves the selected sensor's copies by "
"the same camera-local translation and rotation across all environments, "
"including copies not displayed. It does not move other camera choices. These"
" are real sensor pose changes, so policies and other viewers using that "
"sensor observe the new viewpoint too. Navigation reads the live sensor pose,"
" including parent-body motion, independently of "
"``CameraCfg.update_latest_camera_pose``. Pausing rendering freezes the "
"displayed image and sensor navigation; pausing training alone does not."
msgstr ""
"两个场景相机都必须预先作为 ``CameraCfg`` "
"条目声明在场景中。键鼠导航会对所有环境中所选传感器的副本，施加相同的相机局部平移和旋转，包括未显示的副本；不会移动其他相机选项。这会真正改变传感器位姿，因此使用该传感器的策略和其他查看器也会看到新视角。导航读取实时传感器位姿，包括父刚体运动，不受"
" ``CameraCfg.update_latest_camera_pose`` 影响。暂停渲染会冻结图像显示和传感器导航，仅暂停训练则不会。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:234
msgid ""
"With ``InteractiveSceneCfg.lazy_sensor_update=True``, the viewer reads only "
"the selected camera. Unselected cameras are still allocated and may render "
"if another consumer reads them or the scene uses eager sensor updates. "
"``streaming_envs`` selects displayed tiles, not capture work."
msgstr ""
"当 ``InteractiveSceneCfg.lazy_sensor_update=True`` "
"时，查看器仅读取选中的相机。未选中的相机仍会分配资源，且在其他使用者读取或场景采用即时传感器更新时，仍可能渲染。``streaming_envs`` "
"选择显示的平铺图像，不决定捕获工作量。"

