#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:250
msgid "Example 1: Following AnymalD Robots"
msgstr "示例 1：跟随 AnymalD 机器人"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:271
msgid ""
"The script adds a ``CameraCfg`` beneath each robot's base before "
"constructing the environment. Its offset defines the view relative to the "
"base, so the camera follows the robot through the normal sensor lifecycle. "
"Of the 256 environments, 36 are sampled for display."
msgstr ""
"脚本在构造环境前，为每个机器人的基座下添加 ``CameraCfg``。其偏移定义相对于基座的视图，因此相机通过正常传感器生命周期跟随机器人。在 256"
" 个环境中抽取 36 个用于显示。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:288
msgid "Example 2: Streaming from Robot-Mounted Cameras"
msgstr "示例 2：传输机器人搭载相机的画面"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:309
msgid ""
"The Galbot cube-stacking environment ships with wrist-mounted cameras giving"
" an egocentric view of the gripper, table, and cubes. The script's "
"``NewtonGLVisualizerCfg`` streams from the existing sensor at "
"``/World/envs/env_.*/Robot/head_camera_sim_view_frame/head_camera``; edit "
"``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` to show a different camera. Of the 25 "
"environments, 12 camera feeds are shown by default."
msgstr ""
"Galbot 立方体堆叠环境自带腕部相机，可以从第一视角观察夹爪、桌面和立方体。脚本中的 ``NewtonGLVisualizerCfg`` 使用 "
"``/World/envs/env_.*/Robot/head_camera_sim_view_frame/head_camera`` "
"处的已有传感器传输画面；修改 ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` 可显示其他相机。默认显示 25 个环境中 12 "
"个相机的画面。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:328
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:330
msgid ""
"Declare camera resolution, pose, renderer, and output types on ``CameraCfg``"
" in the scene. Then choose what to display in ``VisualizerCfg``:"
msgstr "在场景的 ``CameraCfg`` 上声明分辨率、位姿、渲染器和输出类型，再在 ``VisualizerCfg`` 中选择显示内容："

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:333
msgid ""
"``cameras=[SceneCameraCfg(prim_path=...)]`` selects a scene camera; "
"``view=ImageViewCfg(source=\"name\")`` selects a named sensor and its image "
"layout. Newton RTX uses these explicit declarations."
msgstr ""
"``cameras=[SceneCameraCfg(prim_path=...)]`` "
"选择场景相机，``view=ImageViewCfg(source=\"name\")`` 选择具名传感器及其图像布局。Newton RTX "
"使用这些显式声明。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:335
msgid ""
"For other viewers, ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` selects a scene "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera` by its configured prim path. The "
"``{ENV_REGEX_NS}`` macro uses the scene's environment template. If omitted, "
"Newton GL starts in perspective mode and offers compatible scene cameras in "
"the Camera View dropdown. Kit and web viewers select the first compatible "
"scene camera; without one, their panel stays empty."
msgstr ""
"对于其他查看器，``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` 按配置的 prim 路径选择场景 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera`，``{ENV_REGEX_NS}`` 宏使用场景的环境模板。省略时，Newton "
"GL 从透视模式启动，并在 Camera View 下拉框中列出兼容场景相机。Kit 和 Web 查看器选择第一个兼容场景相机，若没有则面板为空。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:340
msgid ""
"``streaming_envs`` controls how many environment tiles are shown. Pass an "
"``int`` to randomly sample that many environments, or a ``list[int]`` to pin"
" specific environment indices."
msgstr ""
"``streaming_envs`` 控制显示的环境格数。传入 ``int`` 可随机抽取指定数量的环境，传入 ``list[int]`` "
"则可固定显示指定索引的环境。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:342
msgid ""
"``streaming_gt_types`` selects which ground-truth types are shown, e.g. "
"``[\"rgb\", \"depth\", \"segmentation\", \"normals\"]``."
msgstr ""
"``streaming_gt_types`` 选择显示的真值类型，例如 ``[\"rgb\", \"depth\", \"segmentation\","
" \"normals\"]`` 。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:344
msgid ""
"``streaming_depth_min`` / ``streaming_depth_max`` set the depth colormap "
"range in metres."
msgstr "``streaming_depth_min`` / ``streaming_depth_max`` 设置深度色图的范围，单位为米。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:346
msgid ""
"Image layouts and color tables are prepared when the selection or layout "
"changes. Colorization and tiling run on the source device and reuse the "
"output buffer. Kit presents CUDA images directly; recording and web "
"consumers read back the composed RGB image through "
"``render_tiled_rgb_array()``."
msgstr ""
"选择或布局变化时，会准备图像布局和颜色表。着色与平铺在源设备上执行，并复用输出缓冲区。Kit 直接显示 CUDA 图像，录制和 Web 使用者则通过 "
"``render_tiled_rgb_array()`` 回读合成 RGB 图像。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:352
msgid "Display sources"
msgstr "显示源"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:354
msgid ""
"``VisualizerCfg.cameras`` accepts ``PerspectiveCameraCfg`` for the "
"interactive view and ``SceneCameraCfg(prim_path=...)`` for a camera sensor "
"already declared in the scene. Newton GL and RTX provide a source dropdown; "
"Kit, Rerun, and Viser use the first scene source in their camera panel. "
"Every explicit scene source must provide the requested "
"``streaming_gt_types`` channels."
msgstr ""
"``VisualizerCfg.cameras`` 接受 ``PerspectiveCameraCfg`` 定义交互视图，接受 "
"``SceneCameraCfg(prim_path=...)`` 选择场景中已有的相机传感器。Newton GL 和 RTX "
"提供来源下拉框，Kit、Rerun 和 Viser 则在相机面板中使用第一个场景来源。每个显式场景来源都必须提供所请求的 "
"``streaming_gt_types`` 通道。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:362
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:364
msgid ""
"``--video viz:newton_gl:streaming_view`` records the selected scene-camera "
"tiles, not a network stream. Without ``--viz``, capture runs on demand "
"without opening a window. Adding ``--viz newton_gl`` displays the "
"visualizer; it is not required to advance recorded frames. A new physics "
"step refreshes the image, while repeated captures within the same step reuse"
" it."
msgstr ""
"``--video viz:newton_gl:streaming_view`` 录制选定场景相机的平铺图像，而不是网络流。未设置 ``--viz`` "
"时，捕获按需执行，不打开窗口。添加 ``--viz newton_gl`` "
"可显示可视化器，但推进录制帧并不需要它。新的物理步会刷新图像，同一步内重复捕获则复用图像。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:369
msgid ""
"If a view reports no matching camera, declare a ``CameraCfg`` in the scene "
"and select it with ``cameras=[SceneCameraCfg(prim_path=...)]`` or "
"``view=ImageViewCfg(source=\"name\")``."
msgstr ""
"若视图提示没有匹配相机，请在场景中声明 ``CameraCfg``，并通过 "
"``cameras=[SceneCameraCfg(prim_path=...)]`` 或 "
"``view=ImageViewCfg(source=\"name\")`` 选择它。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:371
msgid ""
"Each ``streaming_gt_types`` entry must have a corresponding output in the "
"selected camera's ``data_types``; ``rgba`` also satisfies an ``rgb`` "
"request. Automatically offered cameras support every requested channel. "
"Explicitly selecting an incompatible camera raises an error."
msgstr ""
"每个 ``streaming_gt_types`` 条目都必须在所选相机的 ``data_types`` 中有对应输出；``rgba`` 也满足 "
"``rgb`` 请求。自动列出的相机支持所有所需通道，显式选择不兼容相机会报错。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:374
msgid ""
"If the depth panel shows a flat color, adjust ``streaming_depth_min`` and "
"``streaming_depth_max`` to bracket the expected depth range in your scene."
msgstr ""
"如果深度面板只显示单一颜色，请调整 ``streaming_depth_min`` 和 ``streaming_depth_max`` "
"，使其覆盖场景中预期的深度范围。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:376
msgid ""
"If the view is too expensive, reduce ``streaming_envs``, ``--num_envs``, or "
"the camera resolution."
msgstr "如果视图开销过大，可减小 ``streaming_envs`` 、 ``--num_envs`` 或相机分辨率。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:381
msgid "Migrating from generated cameras"
msgstr "从自动生成相机迁移"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:383
msgid ""
"Visualizers no longer create or destroy camera sensors. Replace "
"``streaming_cam_target_prim_path``, ``streaming_cam_eye``, and "
"``streaming_cam_renderer_cfg`` with a scene ``CameraCfg``: place its "
"``prim_path`` under the desired parent, set its ``offset``, and supply "
"``renderer_cfg`` there. Select that camera through "
"``cameras=[SceneCameraCfg(...)]``. This puts the camera in the clone plan "
"and the normal sensor initialization, update, and teardown lifecycle. The "
"full option mapping is in the :doc:`3.0 migration guide "
"</source/isaaclab/migrating>`."
msgstr ""
"可视化器不再创建或销毁相机传感器。请用场景中的 ``CameraCfg`` 替换 "
"``streaming_cam_target_prim_path``、``streaming_cam_eye`` 和 "
"``streaming_cam_renderer_cfg``：将 ``prim_path`` 放在所需父节点下，在相机配置中设置 ``offset`` "
"和 ``renderer_cfg``，再通过 ``cameras=[SceneCameraCfg(...)]`` "
"选择它。这样，相机就纳入克隆计划及正常的传感器初始化、更新和销毁生命周期。完整选项对照见 :doc:`3.0 迁移指南 "
"</source/isaaclab/migrating>`。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:392
msgid ""
"Closing a visualizer does not affect the camera or other visualizers reading"
" it. ``streaming_envs`` selects displayed tiles, not camera allocation or "
"capture resolution."
msgstr ""
"关闭可视化器不会影响相机，也不会影响读取同一相机的其他可视化器。``streaming_envs`` "
"选择显示的平铺图像，不决定相机资源分配或捕获分辨率。"

